==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Spidops|9}}, one of the {{TCG|SVP Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Bind Down''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Leafeon|7}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

